{"w":2400,"h":3170,"lines":[{"t":"Test 2","x":0.84261036378192578,"y":0.046372239932464865,"c":1,"h":0.014826498422712886,"w":0.059500961303710964},{"w":0.040307102203369152,"t":"JULIE:","y":0.095930232645026092,"x":0.088291746571060134,"h":0.0087209298407617819,"c":1},{"w":0.038387715021769214,"t":"CARL:","h":0.010174418548680286,"y":0.11191860465237347,"c":1,"x":0.088291747004723059},{"x":0.086372361695437147,"w":0.042226486206054695,"c":1,"y":0.12790697648797966,"t":"JULIE:","h":0.011627907256598791},{"w":0.042226486206054695,"h":0.011627907256598791,"t":"CARL:","x":0.086372361407529283,"y":0.17587209285425875,"c":1},{"x":0.08829174630714462,"w":0.040307102203369138,"h":0.0087209304424491485,"t":"JOLIE.","y":0.19331395336266244,"c":1},{"y":0.23982558125376063,"t":"CARL:","x":0.088291748408438009,"w":0.040307099024454757,"h":0.010174418548680286,"c":1},{"t":"JULIE:","h":0.010174418548680286,"c":1,"w":0.046065257390340161,"y":0.27325581395724896,"x":0.08445297582909643},{"t":"CARL.","y":0.30523255801163962,"x":0.088291746307144592,"h":0.0087209304424490375,"w":0.040307102203369138,"c":1},{"y":0.32105342517791646,"t":"JULIE:","x":0.086310223872892985,"w":0.040431375503540048,"c":1,"h":0.0090559402850900472},{"y":0.33575581408381816,"t":"CARL:","w":0.042226486206054695,"h":0.013081394761142784,"x":0.086372361791406435,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"JULIE:","x":0.088146932555305438,"y":0.35283720005013497,"h":0.0094418787429760842,"w":0.036757958730061838},{"w":0.042226486206054695,"t":"CARL:","x":0.086372361407529283,"h":0.011627907256598791,"y":0.36918604634263086,"c":1},{"y":0.096330972251904012,"c":1,"x":0.18203158534624925,"t":"lam, yes.","w":0.077290388743082694,"h":0.011523305128801509},{"c":1,"h":0.014589905362775935,"x":0.18426104212634878,"y":0.11041009450683092,"t":"So do you do any sport on a regular basis?","w":0.33205373128255211},{"x":0.18234165478532285,"t":"Yes. I play a lot of tennis. I belong to a club so I go there a lot. I'm quite","y":0.12645348848793392,"w":0.54702494303385418,"h":0.014555975014479028,"c":1},{"t":"competitive so I enjoy that side of it as well as the exercise. But I haven't gone","x":0.18033273220049295,"y":0.14121283190430822,"h":0.017935035055744231,"w":0.60478973388671875,"c":1},{"w":0.13865577697753903,"y":0.15826692762675088,"c":1,"x":0.1821278729759844,"h":0.014791559646558317,"t":"since this started."},{"t":"Sure. And do you do any other types of exercise?","y":0.17441860460514713,"x":0.18234164786623702,"w":0.38195777893066413,"c":1,"h":0.016117672965353602},{"x":0.18234165665061292,"t":"Yeah, I sometimes do a little swimming, but usually just when I'm on","y":0.19040697685714303,"w":0.52399230957031251,"h":0.014640341797837686,"c":1},{"y":0.20609538383531967,"c":1,"w":0.55293182373046879,"x":0.18034304429676279,"t":"vacation. But normally I go running a few times a week, maybe three or","h":0.018195107156169898},{"t":"four times.","w":0.088911368052164708,"x":0.17822044765397044,"y":0.22266626674798706,"c":1,"h":0.015384057944505258},{"t":"Hmm. So your legs are getting quite a pounding. But you haven't had any","h":0.017917386364861621,"y":0.23833472570154135,"w":0.56827336629231773,"x":0.18035723695215902,"c":1},{"w":0.16314778645833333,"y":0.25581395334025614,"t":"problems up to now?","x":0.18234165371873956,"h":0.011693932807031904,"c":1},{"x":0.18035067876490615,"c":1,"t":"No, not with my legs. I did have an accident last year when I slipped and hurt my","y":0.27031619542347241,"w":0.62392817179361981,"h":0.017724852456655449},{"x":0.18234164732801703,"t":"shoulder. but that's better now.","y":0.28769716103059406,"w":0.23800384521484372,"h":0.011721443753889282,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.30227180607416781,"t":"Excellent. And do you have any allergies?","x":0.18222838353807325,"w":0.32457239786783854,"h":0.0169122473298563},{"x":0.18042226171628595,"t":"No, none that I'm aware of.","y":0.31976744197967055,"w":0.21113244374593099,"h":0.014617416309633535,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.18042226011813342,"y":0.33564668786161289,"t":"And do you take any medication on a regular basis?","w":0.40499041239420563,"h":0.014644009683410397},{"w":0.46833012898763021,"c":1,"h":0.014544053784680377,"t":"Well. I take vitamins but that's all. I'm generally very healthy.","x":0.18042226745895135,"y":0.35173501585366718},{"h":0.014601826592574696,"t":"OK, well let's have a closer look and see what might be causing this problem.","y":0.36773255826301421,"x":0.18234165930839083,"w":0.59692896525065098,"c":1},{"x":0.18216669560103735,"t":"If you can just get up ...","y":0.38359176729390287,"w":0.18465540568033853,"h":0.015444528718099981,"c":1},{"y":0.12790697698772024,"t":"Q7","w":0.026871401468912759,"h":0.013081394761142673,"c":1,"x":0.81957773487753238},{"w":0.026871401468912759,"y":0.2078488374486438,"t":"128","h":0.013081394761142673,"x":0.81765834908959989,"c":1},{"x":0.8195777352846001,"y":0.3517441863018842,"w":0.034548943837483748,"c":1,"h":0.013081394761142784,"t":"Q10"},{"x":0.088291746569511817,"y":0.43596214496092045,"c":1,"w":0.14971209208170572,"h":0.014619250252419835,"t":"SECTION 2"},{"c":1,"y":0.46498422688902241,"w":0.71017272949218746,"t":"We'll be arriving at Branley Castle in about five minutes, but before we get there I'll give you","h":0.014666935773301915,"x":0.086372368340768071},{"x":0.088291736199389514,"h":0.013249211356466839,"w":0.52207295735677084,"c":1,"t":"a little information about the castle and what our visit will include.","y":0.4810725550486592},{"w":0.70057581583658846,"h":0.014566979874571784,"c":1,"x":0.088291754109856513,"t":"So in fact there's been a castle on this site for over eleven hundred years. The first building","y":0.50436046499996556},{"h":0.015988372176979571,"t":"was a fort constructed in 914 AD for defence against Danish invaders by King Alfred the","y":0.5203488370074405,"w":0.67946253458658856,"x":0.086372384069469579,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.5377906979663134,"w":0.70441457112630201,"x":0.090211140435932105,"h":0.013081394761142673,"t":"Great's daughter, who ruled England at the time. In the following century, after the Normans"},{"w":0.70633397420247401,"c":1,"x":0.086372360223068753,"t":"conquered England, the land was given to a nobleman called Richard de Vere, and he built","h":0.016139681482164714,"y":0.5536277604178339},{"w":0.58157389322916664,"c":1,"y":0.56971608857690403,"h":0.014586236875515968,"x":0.086372362303332867,"t":"a castle there that stayed in the de Vere family for over four hundred years."},{"x":0.088291746496558215,"t":"However, when Queen Elizabeth I announced that she was going to visit the castle in 1576","h":0.016125009338186391,"y":0.593023255769767,"w":0.70057581583658857,"c":1},{"h":0.013249211356466839,"c":1,"x":0.088291737856479716,"t":"it was beginning to look a bit run down, and it was decided that rather than repair the guest","y":0.61041009467741503,"w":0.70249521891276046},{"h":0.016452286296086305,"c":1,"x":0.086322184692153886,"t":"rooms, they'd make a new house for her out of wood next to the main hall. She stayed there","y":0.6246780881155487,"w":0.71219167073567702},{"t":"for four nights and apparently it was very luxurious, but unfortunately it was destroyed a few","x":0.086372368360094362,"c":1,"y":0.64098837204881198,"h":0.016109419621127663,"w":0.71017272949218757},{"y":0.65835962165681905,"t":"years later by fire.","w":0.1439539337158203,"x":0.086372361292281763,"h":0.014605494478147518,"c":1},{"h":0.014534883469061177,"c":1,"t":"In the seventeenth century the castle belonged to the wealthy Fenys family, who enlarged","x":0.086372369849556971,"y":0.68168604663509058,"w":0.69289825439453123},{"c":1,"t":"it and made it more comfortable. However, by 1982 the Fenys family could no longer afford","x":0.086372352115365064,"h":0.014628420568039036,"w":0.70249521891276034,"y":0.69767441872745317},{"y":0.71213387935517558,"t":"to maintain the castle, even though they received government support, and they put it on","x":0.088237645270164741,"w":0.68533172607421877,"c":1,"h":0.016629997036810562},{"h":0.014534883469061066,"t":"the market. It was eventually taken over by a company who owned a number of amusement","y":0.72965116291323628,"x":0.086372351108797998,"w":0.71401153564453124,"c":1},{"y":0.74447529407563606,"t":"parks. but when we get there I think you'll see that they've managed to retain the original","x":0.090131368257937938,"w":0.68537999471028654,"h":0.016832925694222012,"c":1},{"h":0.015771023482554436,"x":0.090064205525347302,"w":0.19806175231933595,"t":"atmosphere of the castle.","y":0.7604700542290147,"c":1},{"h":0.019565447497443045,"c":1,"t":"When you go inside, you'll find that in the state rooms there are life-like moving wax models","x":0.08819383926600409,"y":0.78361367674002702,"w":0.71032440185546875},{"y":0.80220820212849731,"w":0.67370442708333322,"h":0.013249211356466839,"t":"dressed in costumes of different periods in the past, which even carry on conversations","x":0.08829174030115558,"c":1},{"w":0.7082533772786459,"c":1,"y":0.81829652968683253,"h":0.011671924290220792,"t":"together. As well as that, in every room there are booklets giving information about what the","x":0.088291737379439225},{"h":0.013249211356466839,"x":0.0882917410239457,"y":0.83280757077698853,"c":1,"w":0.56621882120768241,"t":"room was used for and the history of the objects and furniture it contains."},{"y":0.85610465128205782,"x":0.090211132516473072,"h":0.014557809558952584,"c":1,"w":0.70057581583658857,"t":"The castle park's quite extensive. At one time sheep were kept there, and in the nineteenth"},{"x":0.088238756679465194,"w":0.66611836751302078,"y":0.87161678287888356,"t":"century the owners had a little zoo with animals like rabbits and even a baby elephant.","h":0.016616800831695477,"c":1},{"t":"Nowadays the old zoo buildings are used for public displays of paintings and sculpture. The","x":0.088253349519913704,"w":0.70833730061848954,"h":0.016578007646915638,"c":1,"y":0.88801082202329329},{"h":0.018827272890494018,"t":"park also has some beautiful trees, though the oldest of all, which dated back 800 years, was","c":1,"x":0.08821517892580602,"w":0.71992624918619796,"y":0.90365552681053574},{"c":1,"t":"sadly blown down in 1987.","x":0.090211136145898124,"y":0.92145110431523247,"h":0.01324921135646695,"w":0.20729366302490235},{"w":0.034548943837483748,"y":0.62500000025296787,"c":1,"h":0.013081394761142673,"x":0.81957773527895483,"t":"Q11"},{"w":0.036468331019083644,"x":0.81957773458642735,"h":0.01162790725659868,"c":1,"y":0.7296511626165707,"t":"Q12"},{"t":"Q13","x":0.8214971213634078,"h":0.013081394761142673,"w":0.034548943837483748,"c":1,"y":0.78488372106056237},{"x":0.821497120377641,"w":0.036468331019083644,"t":"Q14","h":0.01162790725659868,"c":1,"y":0.88808139517661022},{"t":"103","y":0.95203488397630265,"x":0.8675623795000551,"h":0.013081394761142673,"c":1,"w":0.036468331019083644}]}